        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.75,
          "end": 98.75,
          "en": "and you need to import it from \"@angular/core.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.85,
          "end": 102.39699999999999,
          "en": "So make sure to add this import at the top,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.39699999999999,
          "end": 105.42,
          "en": "\"pipeTransform from @angular/core.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.42,
          "end": 107.1,
          "en": "And with that implemented,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.1,
          "end": 109.68,
          "en": "you see that I now get an error in my IDE.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.68,
          "end": 113.4,
          "en": "You would also get an error if you now try to compile this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.4,
          "end": 115.02000000000001,
          "en": "because what we need to do here is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.02000000000001,
          "end": 120.02,
          "en": "we need to apply or we need to provide the transform method.",
